title: "Della Vedova Prediction Market Indices"
abstract: "The Della Vedova Prediction Market Indices (DV-PMI) are a weekly-updated family of behavioral and microstructure indices derived from on-chain prediction-market trade data, including probability weighting, execution edge, private information, and market calibration metrics. Current coverage: Polymarket."
type: dataset
